# A crafted permanent that leaves and returns is a new object with its front face up (CR 400.7, 712.14): Ephemerate exiles
# Oteclan Levitator and returns it as Oteclan Landmark, whose "When this artifact enters, scry 2" triggers again. The
# Ornithopter exiled to craft it stays in exile. The Landmark is no creature, so the rebound copy of Ephemerate on turn
# five has nothing to target.

[Bot1 Deck]
Plains
Oteclan Landmark
Mox Pearl
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Ornithopter
Island
Ephemerate
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

