? Bot1.Battlefield.Oteclan Levitator.Types = Artifact; Creature
Bot1.Battlefield.Plains.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Ephemerate.Cast(Oteclan Levitator)
Bot1.Arrange(| Island; Island)
